      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Chaining styles\n\nEvery style node has a `base` input. Wire one style INTO another's `base` and the second layers its override on top.\n\nFill (yellow) → Stroke (black, 6px) → Rect. The rectangle has both fill AND stroke.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 220
      },
